    "chunk_text": "orus gehaten; hit is on leafum & on bogum morbeame gelic, bi\u00f0 swa \u00feeah Hit getacna\u00fe \u00fea halgan rode, \u00fee \u00fea geleaffullan lufia\u00f0, & \u00fea ungeleaffullan forseo\u00f0. Mid \u00fe\u00e6re halgan rode tacne we us bletsia\u00f0 on Godes naman, & we beo\u00f0 wi\u00f0 deofles costunga gescylde, Be \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00fe se apostol Paulus, Nos autem predicamus Christum crucifixum, iudeis quidem Zacheus is gecweden iustificatus, \u00fe\u00e6t is gerihtwisod, for\u00fean\u00fee god hine gerihtwisode, & he getacna\u00fe Swaswa Zacheus astah \u00fe\u00e6t treow \u00fe\u00e6t he mihte beon geuferod, swa astiga\u00f0 \u00fea geleaffullan, \u00feonne hi Be \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00fe eft se ylca \u00feeoda lareow, Non enim iudicaui me scire aliquid inter uos, nisi christum \u00d0eos is seo hergendlice ea\u00f0modnes \u00fe\u00e6t se h\u00e6lend wolde for us \u00ferowian, & mid his anes dea\u00f0e ealne Hit \u00feuhte \u00feam dysegum h\u00e6\u00feenum \u00fe\u00e6t seo d\u00e6d waclic w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde sylfwilles on rode beon Ne mihte na\u00feor ne engel ne heahengel, ne heahf\u00e6der ne witega, ne apostol, ne nan o\u00f0er halga, ne gold Se h\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Zachee, nu to d\u00e6g me gedafena\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t ic to \u00feinre dugo\u00f0e gecyrre, & \u00fe\u00e6t ic on Hine gela\u00feode hwilon sum iudeisc sundorhalga to his huse, ac he hine ne underfeng na mid swilcum We magon eac gewislicor eow onwreon be \u00fean. Sum iudeisc sundorhalga w\u00e6s ge",
